<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-21T02:42:19.983Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:42:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard commander was temporarily relieved while an investigation proceeds, and the service held an anti-trafficking session in Tuguegarao. China deployed coast guard and naval vessels to four West Philippine Sea sites, prompting legislator Tarriela to condemn the incursions and defend the 2016 arbitral ruling. France and India deepened maritime security cooperation with the Philippines during visits and agreements, and the Philippines is evaluating Brazil's KC-390 transport aircraft. President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. hosted U.S. President Donald Trump for a state visit that included defence talks, and the UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE83S2hqRXZIWXhWamIyX3ZlNVhzY1N4NERMSkdKbHotTWcwSUY4cTJ1LTdvalAzenRBLU5JeXZKZ0pDaFl3VEhBQ2JfQUxhUllLdTBZRXBpZm4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Politiko.com.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE81bi0yYk9pVFBsY0ZWZExyNUJzZnBGbW9BX0VOeXRkcm50XzJrMGZwcFVwZExCaWJiTU9MVGxfT1o0VWZxcFQ0MmdqSzNGdzV4ZkpsU1MyamJwR2FVVmtaWVl0dUR3NjdSZFRJYTQ1X3YzdUZZNE1kSXdMTF9mdDA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNNXljc3dJeWlsM1lXVzN0RXRxd051cTltR29MV3NKd1JhVno5V3BXb242c1lubUdmbGhoUUZCbEV3SmdsYjdzbWhKcnNycWduWXdud0NqUFJqcnVaaHF6T0pHdW5FVy1ZLUExalNHdnRPTUpGTktndUdpdWJZVVFWMzBXUkRfLXJwdWs3UmhNa1A1bFhrMDhNZnNEakloZWV3NlNLZkFxMXg4ZFhURGx4VU9ORGZsWVIzdHgtcW5pWjVrSl85bGtCMzFobzE0dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Military Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOVjM3cEctMWs1ZE5iQjZwcWE0T2JPWjVvY0VFWWQzdU1FODJBQmRJ